    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VOC Sensor Data</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>VOC Sensor Data</h1>
        <div id="sensor-data">
            <p>Sensor ID: <span id="sensor-id">Loading...</span></p>
            <p>Value: <span id="sensor-value">Loading...</span> ppb</p>
            <p>Timestamp: <span id="sensor-timestamp">Loading...</span></p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

#### CSS (styles.css)

```css
body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
}

.container {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: auto;
    background: white;
